Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或许再等一会儿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Maybe a little longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在这些食谱当中  有些用量可能不太寻常{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}In some of these recipes, the quantities may seem a little unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.65,0:18:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}比如说椰子摩克力坚果棒{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, like these coconut Mockolate holiday nut bars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我用四杯椰子粉和四杯碎坚果{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I've indicated four cups of coconut and four cups of crushed nuts...{\r}
