Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}无所谓了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Doesn't matter.{\r}
