Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:08.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们的食品认证没有下来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Our FDA approval didn't come through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为白老鼠实验没过{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Something about laboratory rats. Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我很遗憾  是啊  不过  这是你的支票{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, gosh, I'm sorry. - Yeah. Well, anyhoo, here's your check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.85,0:19:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}感谢你这么费心准备{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Thank you for all you went through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.85,0:19:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听着  你在准备时没吃太多吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, listen, you didn't eat a lot of it while you were cooking, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我是吃了一点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, I ate some.{\r}
