Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.15,0:19:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哈哈哈  好吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha-ha-ha. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你尿尿时没有灼痛的感觉吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So it doesn't burn when you pee, does it?{\r}
