Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嗨{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}又是他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Is that him again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}告诉他  我想接电话  但我的脚踝重到我走不动{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Tell him I'd come to the phone, but my ankles are weighing me down.{\r}
