Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}下一首是罗斯要献给瑞秋的歌{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The next one's dedicated to Rachel from Ross.{\r}
