Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那真是太可怕了 罗斯  如果你在听的话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's pretty appalling. And, Ross, if you're listening...{\r}
