Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们何不将时间留给还有机会的情侣{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Why don't we devote our time to a couple that stands a chance?{\r}
